  "description": "<p>This task is to update the the fcrepo/pom.xml to use the latest version of the DuraSpace checkstyle configuration: 1.0.1</p>\n\n<p>The updated version of of the checkstyle rules reinstitutes a 120 character line length limit, with the exception of lines that match the following patterns:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>^package.*</li>\n\t<li>^import.*</li>\n\t<li>http://</li>\n\t<li>https://</li>\n\t<li>@link</li>\n</ul>\n",
